{
  "book": "MRK",
  "chapter": 16,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "marker": "p",
      "role": "scripture",
      "sourceId": "engylt_usfx.xml#book[@id=\"MRK\"]/p[37]",
      "runs": [
        {
          "verse": "1",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.1",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.1"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "And the sabbath having past, Mary the Magdalene, and Mary of James, and Salome, bought spices, that having come, they may anoint him,\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.1",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.1"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.1",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.1"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.1"
        },
        {
          "verse": "2",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.2",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.2"
        },
        {
          "text": "and early in the morning of the first of the sabbaths, they come unto the sepulchre, at the rising of the sun,\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.2",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.2"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.2",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.2"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.2"
        },
        {
          "verse": "3",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.3",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.3"
        },
        {
          "text": "and they said among themselves, 'Who shall roll away for us the stone out of the door of the sepulchre?'\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.3",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.3"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.3",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.3"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.3"
        },
        {
          "verse": "4",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.4",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.4"
        },
        {
          "text": "And having looked, they see that the stone hath been rolled away — for it was very great,\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.4",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.4"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.4",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.4"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.4"
        },
        {
          "verse": "5",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.5",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.5"
        },
        {
          "text": "and having entered into the sepulchre, they saw a young man sitting on the right hand, arrayed in a long white robe, and they were amazed.\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.5",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.5"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.5",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.5"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.5"
        },
        {
          "verse": "6",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.6",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.6"
        },
        {
          "text": "And he saith to them, 'Be not amazed, ye seek Jesus the Nazarene, the crucified: he did rise — he is not here; lo, the place where they laid him!\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.6",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.6"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.6",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.6"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.6"
        },
        {
          "verse": "7",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.7",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.7"
        },
        {
          "text": "and go, say to his disciples, and Peter, that he doth go before you to Galilee; there ye shall see him, as he said to you.'\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.7",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.7"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.7",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.7"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.7"
        },
        {
          "verse": "8",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.8",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.8"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.8"
        },
        {
          "text": "And, having come forth quickly, they fled from the sepulchre, and trembling and amazement had seized them, and to no one said they anything, for they were afraid.\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.8",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.8"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.8"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.8",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.8"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.8"
        },
        {
          "verse": "9",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.9",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.9"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.9"
        },
        {
          "text": "And he, having risen in the morning of the first of the sabbaths, did appear first to Mary the Magdalene, out of whom he had cast seven demons;\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.9",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.9"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.9"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.9",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.9"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.9"
        },
        {
          "verse": "10",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.10",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.10"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.10"
        },
        {
          "text": "she having gone, told those who had been with him, mourning and weeping;\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.10",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.10"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.10"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.10",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.10"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.10"
        },
        {
          "verse": "11",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.11",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.11"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.11"
        },
        {
          "text": "and they, having heard that he is alive, and was seen by her, did not believe.\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.11",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.11"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.11"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.11",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.11"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.11"
        },
        {
          "verse": "12",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.12",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.12"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.12"
        },
        {
          "text": "And after these things, to two of them, as they are going into a field, walking, he was manifested in another form,\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.12",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.12"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.12"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.12",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.12"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.12"
        },
        {
          "verse": "13",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.13",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.13"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.13"
        },
        {
          "text": "and they having gone, told to the rest; not even them did they believe.\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.13",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.13"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.13"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.13",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.13"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.13"
        },
        {
          "verse": "14",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.14",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.14"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Afterwards, as they are reclining (at meat), he was manifested to the eleven, and did reproach their unbelief and stiffness of heart, because they believed not those having seen him being raised;\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.14",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.14"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.14"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.14",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.14"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.14"
        },
        {
          "verse": "15",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.15",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.15"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.15"
        },
        {
          "text": "and he said to them, 'Having gone to all the world, proclaim the good news to all the creation;\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.15",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.15"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.15"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.15",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.15"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.15"
        },
        {
          "verse": "16",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.16",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.16"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.16"
        },
        {
          "text": "he who hath believed, and hath been baptized, shall be saved; and he who hath not believed, shall be condemned.\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.16",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.16"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.16"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.16",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.16"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.16"
        },
        {
          "verse": "17",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.17",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.17"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.17"
        },
        {
          "text": "'And signs shall accompany those believing these things; in my name demons they shall cast out; with new tongues they shall speak;\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.17",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.17"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.17"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.17",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.17"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.17"
        },
        {
          "verse": "18",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.18",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.18"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.18"
        },
        {
          "text": "serpents they shall take up; and if any deadly thing they may drink, it shall not hurt them; on the ailing they shall lay hands, and they shall be well.'\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.18",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.18"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.18"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.18",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.18"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.18"
        },
        {
          "verse": "19",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.19",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.19"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.19"
        },
        {
          "text": "The Lord, then, indeed, after speaking to them, was received up to the heaven, and sat on the right hand of God;\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.19",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.19"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.19"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.19",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.19"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.19"
        },
        {
          "verse": "20",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.20",
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.20"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.20"
        },
        {
          "text": "and they, having gone forth, did preach everywhere, the Lord working with [them], and confirming the word, through the signs following. Amen.\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.20",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.20"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.20"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "anchor": "MRK.16.20",
          "marks": [],
          "anchors": [
            "MRK.16.20"
          ],
          "sourceAnchor": "MRK.16.20"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
